<title>UK: Citibank set warrants on Swiss Re shares.</title>
<headline>Citibank set warrants on Swiss Re shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. has issued 20,000 warrants on Swiss Reinsurance registered shares, lead manager Citibank (Zurich) said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    *</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1182 CHF (INDICATIVE)</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	24.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	02.OCT.96</p>
<p> NOTES  *THE STRIKE PRICE (CAP LEVEL) IS TO BE SET EQUAL</p>
<p>	   TO THE CLOSE OF THE UNDERLYING ON 25.SEP.96.</p>
<p>	   AT EXPIRY HOLDERS WILL RECEIVE THE CAP AMOUNT IN</p>
<p>	   CASH IF THE UNDERLYING IS AT OR ABOVE THE CAP LEVEL,</p>
<p>	   OR ONE SWISS RE SHARE IF THE UNDERLYING TRADES BELOW</p>
<p>	   THE CAP LEVEL.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
